Package: openvpn-manager
Version: 1.7.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: OpenVPN Manager <root@localhost>
Installed-Size: 140
Depends: python3 (>= 3.7), python3-flask, python3-pip, stunnel4, openvpn
Recommends: lighttpd
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Web GUI for managing OpenVPN clients (Debian 10 Buster)
 A Flask-based HTTPS web interface (port 12322) for creating,
 revoking, renewing and downloading OpenVPN client certificates.
 .
 Compatible with TurnKey Linux OpenVPN on Debian 10 (Buster).
 Installs gunicorn and python-pam automatically via pip3.
 .
 Features: PAM authentication, CSRF protection, brute-force
 lockout, security headers, session timeout, audit logging.
